      "id": "claim_683355b26a0441279e2588f12dc75984",
      "statement": "The installed `SecurityConfig` disables form login, basic authentication, logout, and CSRF; uses stateless sessions; permits configured public paths including `/auth/**`; requires authentication otherwise; restricts `/admin/**` to `ADMIN`; and installs the JWT filter before `UsernamePasswordAuthenticationFilter`.",
